{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/main.ts",
    "title": "服务进程启动入口",
    "summary": "加载运行配置、构建 Fastify 应用并开始监听，同时为常见终止信号注册优雅关闭处理。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "startup",
        "title": "启动链路",
        "body": "该文件是服务进程的最薄入口：先调用 `loadConfig` 得到主机、端口及其他运行配置，再把配置交给 `buildApp` 完成应用和依赖组装，最后监听指定地址并输出可访问 URL。[[c4]] `buildApp` 会创建 Fastify、Store、Runs、MemoryService 与 FeedbackService；非回环地址若没有令牌会直接拒绝启动，因此入口本身依赖应用工厂执行安全检查和模块装配。[[c5]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "shutdown",
        "title": "终止处理与边界",
        "body": "进程收到 `SIGINT` 或 `SIGTERM` 时调用 `app.close()`，待关闭完成后以状态码 0 退出，意图让 Fastify 释放监听器及其生命周期资源。[[c6]] 这里没有为配置加载、构建、监听或关闭失败设置显式恢复逻辑，也没有注册其他终止事件；错误如何记录及退出由顶层运行环境和 Fastify 的 Promise 行为决定。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "服务启动入口",
        "reason": "支持配置加载、应用构建、网络监听和启动日志这一完整入口链路。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/main.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 6
        },
        "quote": "import { buildApp } from \"./app.js\";\nimport { loadConfig } from \"./config.js\";\nconst config = loadConfig();\nconst { app } = await buildApp(config);\nawait app.listen({ port: config.port, host: config.host });\nconsole.log(`omem listening at http://${config.host}:${config.port}`);"
      },
      {
        "key": "c5",
        "label": "应用工厂的安全检查与服务装配",
        "reason": "说明 main 调用的应用工厂负责非回环令牌检查，并实例化存储、运行和记忆服务。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/app.ts",
          "startLine": 44,
          "endLine": 64
        },
        "quote": "export async function buildApp(\n  config: Config,\n  dependencies: {\n    lark?: LarkOnboardingService;\n    larkRuntime?: LarkRuntimeHost;\n  } = {},\n) {\n  if (![\"127.0.0.1\", \"localhost\", \"::1\"].includes(config.host) && !config.token)\n    throw Error(\"OMEM_TOKEN is required for a non-loopback bind\");\n  const app = Fastify"
      },
      {
        "key": "c6",
        "label": "进程信号关闭逻辑",
        "reason": "支持 SIGINT、SIGTERM 下等待应用关闭后正常退出的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/main.ts",
          "startLine": 7,
          "endLine": 10
        },
        "quote": "for (const signal of [\"SIGINT\", \"SIGTERM\"] as const)\n  process.on(signal, () => {\n    void app.close().then(() => process.exit(0));\n  });"
      }
    ],
